# Netlify SPA fallback.
#
# Without this, every route this app owns except "/" returns Netlify's own
# 404: /login, /privacy, /faq and every /chat/** deep link. Verified live on
# areep.netlify.app before this file existed — a user who refreshed the page
# while signed in was thrown out to a hosting error.
#
# Real files on disk win over this rule, so /robots.txt, /sitemap.xml,
# /favicon.svg and everything under /assets/ are still served as themselves.
# The 200 (rather than a redirect) is what keeps the URL in the address bar
# intact so React Router can read it.
/*  /index.html  200
